WEBVTT

1
00:00:42.666 --> 00:00:43.750
Lord Krishna

2
00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.916
now continues describing, in these

3
00:00:45.916 --> 00:00:47.375
sixteenth and seventeenth verses,

4
00:00:47.375 --> 00:00:50.083
the qualities of the Paramatma,

5
00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:52.250
which are the object of knowledge.

6
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:54.041
Earlier He clarified

7
00:00:54.041 --> 00:00:56.416
that the Paramatma is all-pervading

8
00:00:56.416 --> 00:00:59.875
and present within all beings.

9
00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:03.958
Now He reveals the omnipresence and subtle

10
00:01:03.958 --> 00:01:06.666
nature of the Supreme.

11
00:01:11.208 --> 00:01:13.958
Lord Krishna begins by saying

12
00:01:13.958 --> 00:01:18.000
that the Supreme Truth is
bahih antash cha bhutanam –

13
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:18.625
meaning

14
00:01:18.625 --> 00:01:22.625
present both outside and inside all beings.

15
00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:25.458
He pervades everything in the universe,

16
00:01:25.458 --> 00:01:26.916
from the smallest atom

17
00:01:26.916 --> 00:01:27.916
to the vast

18
00:01:27.916 --> 00:01:30.291
cosmic fields.

19
00:01:30.291 --> 00:01:34.458
Acharam charam eva cha – He explains that

20
00:01:34.458 --> 00:01:36.250
He is present in both the moving

21
00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:38.125
and the unmoving.

22
00:01:38.125 --> 00:01:39.083
This includes

23
00:01:39.083 --> 00:01:42.625
all living beings such as humans,
animals, and insects,

24
00:01:42.625 --> 00:01:45.625
as well as unmoving things like trees

25
00:01:45.625 --> 00:01:47.250
and mountains.

26
00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:51.666
But sukshmtvat tat avijneyam reveals that

27
00:01:51.666 --> 00:01:54.541
because the Lord is extremely subtle,

28
00:01:54.541 --> 00:01:56.041
He remains unknowable

29
00:01:56.041 --> 00:01:59.416
to the material senses.

30
00:01:59.416 --> 00:02:02.000
Just as air is present everywhere,

31
00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:03.833
but cannot be seen,

32
00:02:03.833 --> 00:02:05.250
in the same way

33
00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.625
the Lord is all-pervading,

34
00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:09.041
yet remains invisible to those

35
00:02:09.041 --> 00:02:12.458
who do not have spiritual vision.

36
00:02:12.458 --> 00:02:14.625
Lord Krishna says that for the soul

37
00:02:14.625 --> 00:02:16.166
bound within limitations,

38
00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:18.666
absorbed in material activities,

39
00:02:18.666 --> 00:02:19.791
the Lord appears

40
00:02:19.791 --> 00:02:22.708
durastham – far away.

41
00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:24.791
But for one who has developed devotion

42
00:02:24.791 --> 00:02:26.750
and purified the heart,

43
00:02:26.750 --> 00:02:30.750
He is antike – very near –

44
00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:34.791
dwelling in the heart as the Paramatma.

45
00:02:34.791 --> 00:02:38.458
Then Lord Krishna says
avibhaktam cha bhuteshu –

46
00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:39.541
the Lord,

47
00:02:39.541 --> 00:02:42.208
though present in all beings,

48
00:02:42.208 --> 00:02:43.666
is undivided.

49
00:02:43.666 --> 00:02:46.750
Vibhaktam iva cha sthitam suggests that

50
00:02:46.750 --> 00:02:47.458
although

51
00:02:47.458 --> 00:02:50.375
He appears divided –

52
00:02:50.375 --> 00:02:52.916
because He dwells in every heart –

53
00:02:52.916 --> 00:02:56.375
He still remains one.

54
00:02:56.375 --> 00:02:59.166
Understand this through the
example of the sun,

55
00:02:59.166 --> 00:03:00.875
which is reflected in countless

56
00:03:00.875 --> 00:03:02.500
water vessels.

57
00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.750
Each reflection appears separate,

58
00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:07.750
yet the original sun remains the same.

59
00:03:07.750 --> 00:03:09.541
In the same way, the Paramatma

60
00:03:09.541 --> 00:03:11.833
appears in many forms, yet

61
00:03:11.833 --> 00:03:14.958
remains one and undivided.

62
00:03:14.958 --> 00:03:17.833
Bhuta bhartri cha tat jneyam

63
00:03:17.833 --> 00:03:20.333
it emphasises that the Lord

64
00:03:20.333 --> 00:03:22.375
is the sustainer of all beings –

65
00:03:22.375 --> 00:03:24.708
that is - bhuta bhartri.

66
00:03:24.708 --> 00:03:25.666
He nourishes

67
00:03:25.666 --> 00:03:27.916
and maintains every creature

68
00:03:27.916 --> 00:03:31.916
by providing the conditions necessary for life.

69
00:03:31.916 --> 00:03:35.500
But grasishnu prabhavishnu cha shows

70
00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:38.458
that He is also the devourer – grasishnu –

71
00:03:38.458 --> 00:03:40.541
who consumes everything

72
00:03:40.541 --> 00:03:42.625
at the time of cosmic dissolution.

73
00:03:42.625 --> 00:03:45.791
He is also the creator – prabhavishnu –

74
00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:47.500
who brings forth

75
00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:50.541
all existence at the time of creation.

76
00:03:50.541 --> 00:03:52.291
The essence of these verses is

77
00:03:52.291 --> 00:03:54.916
that the Paramatma is the supreme controller,

78
00:03:54.916 --> 00:03:58.166
beyond material perception, who nourishes,

79
00:03:58.166 --> 00:04:02.333
dissolves, and recreates everything
in the universe.

80
00:04:02.333 --> 00:04:03.125
Though

81
00:04:03.125 --> 00:04:04.583
He appears far

82
00:04:04.583 --> 00:04:07.708
to those bound by matter, yet

83
00:04:07.708 --> 00:04:11.000
He is always near and within reach

84
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:13.875
of those who awaken devotion in the mind

85
00:04:13.875 --> 00:04:16.583
and sincerely seek Him.

86
00:04:16.583 --> 00:04:18.250
Always remember –

87
00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:22.500
in every mind, in every particle,
Lord Krishna is present in all.

88
00:04:27.166 --> 00:04:30.208
Does this thought ever come to your mind –

89
00:04:30.208 --> 00:04:32.666
‘If this is true,

90
00:04:32.666 --> 00:04:37.708
then that other thing must be false?’

91
00:04:37.708 --> 00:04:40.250
You often assume that

92
00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:46.083
what is not true is completely false.

93
00:04:46.083 --> 00:04:50.041
But life – and especially spiritual truth –

94
00:04:50.041 --> 00:04:54.000
is not always so simple.

95
00:04:54.000 --> 00:05:00.541
What if opposites could exist together?

96
00:05:00.541 --> 00:05:04.083
If something could be near and far,

97
00:05:04.083 --> 00:05:05.916
visible and invisible,

98
00:05:05.916 --> 00:05:11.750
one and many – all at the same time?

99
00:05:11.750 --> 00:05:15.208
Listen – as the Paramatma,

100
00:05:15.208 --> 00:05:19.375
I am within everything and outside it too.

101
00:05:19.375 --> 00:05:21.708
I am undivided,

102
00:05:21.708 --> 00:05:25.666
yet I appear in every heart.

103
00:05:25.666 --> 00:05:29.583
This may seem like a contradiction,

104
00:05:29.583 --> 00:05:35.041
but that is because you are
trying to contain infinity

105
00:05:35.041 --> 00:05:36.166
within a very

106
00:05:36.166 --> 00:05:40.291
limited range of understanding.

107
00:05:40.291 --> 00:05:43.916
Now you may ask –

108
00:05:43.916 --> 00:05:47.208
‘Then why even try to understand?’

109
00:05:47.208 --> 00:05:51.625
For the same reason that a child goes

110
00:05:51.625 --> 00:05:54.916
to school even before knowing how to read.

111
00:05:54.916 --> 00:05:58.291
Because they want to read, they want to learn!

112
00:05:58.291 --> 00:06:00.041
See –

113
00:06:00.041 --> 00:06:02.291
if you do not know something right now,

114
00:06:02.291 --> 00:06:04.458
that is no problem –

115
00:06:04.458 --> 00:06:06.083
the problem is

116
00:06:06.083 --> 00:06:11.250
having no desire to learn further.

117
00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.666
Divine knowledge

118
00:06:12.666 --> 00:06:16.000
is not for solving a puzzle.

119
00:06:16.000 --> 00:06:17.458
It is for expanding

120
00:06:17.458 --> 00:06:20.416
your awareness.

121
00:06:20.416 --> 00:06:23.750
You do not need to understand everything

122
00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:25.250
at once.

123
00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:30.791
Simply remain curious with a sincere
and open heart.

124
00:06:30.791 --> 00:06:35.000
With time, your understanding will deepen.

125
00:06:35.000 --> 00:06:37.416
And then, in one moment,

126
00:06:37.416 --> 00:06:41.500
you will humbly realise on your own –

127
00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.583
‘Now I know

128
00:06:43.583 --> 00:06:46.875
how little I know.’

129
00:06:46.875 --> 00:06:49.041
With this acceptance,

130
00:06:49.041 --> 00:06:53.166
real wisdom begins to grow.

131
00:06:53.166 --> 00:06:56.500
This humble, curious spirit

132
00:06:56.500 --> 00:07:01.291
opens the path of knowledge for you.

133
00:07:05.916 --> 00:07:07.708
Tell me –

134
00:07:07.708 --> 00:07:09.000
how should the elders

135
00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:12.666
of a family behave?

136
00:07:12.666 --> 00:07:17.958
Full of affection, or strict and discipline-loving?

137
00:07:17.958 --> 00:07:19.500
Understand this

138
00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:22.833
through My form as the Paramatma.

139
00:07:22.833 --> 00:07:28.666
I maintain every being –

140
00:07:28.666 --> 00:07:32.625
ensuring the sun rises, the crops grow,

141
00:07:32.625 --> 00:07:35.500
and breath continues.

142
00:07:35.500 --> 00:07:38.750
But when necessary,

143
00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:42.041
I also bring things to an end.

144
00:07:42.041 --> 00:07:46.541
I save life, and I also take it away.

145
00:07:46.541 --> 00:07:51.250
Both roles are part of My love.

146
00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:53.583
In the family too, elders,

147
00:07:53.583 --> 00:07:57.958
parents and others must maintain
this same balance.

148
00:07:57.958 --> 00:08:01.958
Understand – being a provider
of comfort is easy –

149
00:08:01.958 --> 00:08:05.875
one who gives comfort, care, and affection.

150
00:08:05.875 --> 00:08:10.083
But being a corrector is equally important –

151
00:08:10.083 --> 00:08:12.333
one who sets boundaries,

152
00:08:12.333 --> 00:08:15.708
says ‘no’ when necessary,

153
00:08:15.708 --> 00:08:17.833
and also teaches responsibility

154
00:08:17.833 --> 00:08:19.375
with love.

155
00:08:19.375 --> 00:08:23.333
If you raise children only with affection

156
00:08:23.333 --> 00:08:26.666
and never discipline them,

157
00:08:26.666 --> 00:08:28.458
you create in them

158
00:08:28.458 --> 00:08:31.625
only a sense of entitlement.

159
00:08:31.625 --> 00:08:34.666
On the other hand, if you only correct

160
00:08:34.666 --> 00:08:37.750
and never give affection,

161
00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:42.625
you create distance and fear.

162
00:08:42.625 --> 00:08:46.208
But when you do both together –

163
00:08:46.208 --> 00:08:49.625
nurturing with affection and guiding

164
00:08:49.625 --> 00:08:51.416
with firmness –

165
00:08:51.416 --> 00:08:53.875
you make your home safe,

166
00:08:53.875 --> 00:08:57.833
respectful, and loving.

167
00:08:57.833 --> 00:09:03.541
So do not feel guilty for being firm,

168
00:09:03.541 --> 00:09:07.875
and do not take pride in being only soft.

169
00:09:07.875 --> 00:09:11.500
Learn to do both, as I do.

170
00:09:11.500 --> 00:09:12.625
In this way

171
00:09:12.625 --> 00:09:15.500
you become a balanced

172
00:09:15.500 --> 00:09:17.708
guide for your family –

173
00:09:17.708 --> 00:09:21.708
not only nurturing them with affection,

174
00:09:21.708 --> 00:09:25.666
but also building their disciplined character.

175
00:09:30.166 --> 00:09:32.500
As the Paramatma,

176
00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:36.750
I care for, nourish,

177
00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:40.333
guide, and support everything,

178
00:09:40.333 --> 00:09:44.458
and when necessary, I also remove

179
00:09:44.458 --> 00:09:49.708
from the scene what has become unusable.

180
00:09:49.708 --> 00:09:53.291
This balance is necessary not only

181
00:09:53.291 --> 00:09:56.541
in spiritual life but in leadership too.

182
00:09:56.541 --> 00:09:59.916
If you are in a position of responsibility –

183
00:09:59.916 --> 00:10:04.500
a manager, a team leader,
or a business owner –

184
00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:07.250
then remember: your role

185
00:10:07.250 --> 00:10:10.375
is not only to provide resources

186
00:10:10.375 --> 00:10:11.791
or to support the team

187
00:10:11.791 --> 00:10:15.000
through encouragement,

188
00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:18.791
but also to be a corrector

189
00:10:18.791 --> 00:10:20.708
when things go in the wrong direction.

190
00:10:20.708 --> 00:10:24.500
A leadership that treats its team

191
00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:27.125
only gently

192
00:10:27.125 --> 00:10:29.000
creates an atmosphere

193
00:10:29.000 --> 00:10:32.958
of comfort, not growth.

194
00:10:32.958 --> 00:10:36.208
And one that only criticises

195
00:10:36.208 --> 00:10:40.000
creates fear, not trust.

196
00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:43.416
But when you do both –

197
00:10:43.416 --> 00:10:48.000
appreciating effort and guiding firmly –

198
00:10:48.000 --> 00:10:52.291
you develop in your team both respect

199
00:10:52.291 --> 00:10:55.500
and the capacity to bear pressure.

200
00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.541
To wash a cloth,

201
00:10:57.541 --> 00:10:59.750
it is beaten again and again

202
00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:01.916
against a stone

203
00:11:01.916 --> 00:11:04.958
to remove the dirt. Then after it dries,

204
00:11:04.958 --> 00:11:08.250
it is very carefully and gently

205
00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:13.083
pressed with an iron, and put away neatly
in the cupboard. 

206
00:11:13.083 --> 00:11:15.375
To make it wearable,

207
00:11:15.375 --> 00:11:20.416
both firmness and gentleness must be used.

208
00:11:20.416 --> 00:11:21.916
This same balance

209
00:11:21.916 --> 00:11:25.000
is necessary in every aspect of life.

210
00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:28.708
Leadership is about balance –

211
00:11:28.708 --> 00:11:30.000
just as I

212
00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:31.458
maintain balance

213
00:11:31.458 --> 00:11:33.375
in the universe,

214
00:11:33.375 --> 00:11:36.333
knowing how long to keep things as they are,

215
00:11:36.333 --> 00:11:39.541
and when to transform them.

216
00:11:39.541 --> 00:11:42.750
When you lead in this way,

217
00:11:42.750 --> 00:11:46.791
your team does not only perform well –

218
00:11:46.791 --> 00:11:50.583
it also grows for what lies ahead.
